\] where \(\binom{10}{k}\) is the binomial coefficient. The probability of getting at least 8 heads is the sum of the probabilities of getting exactly 8, 9, and 10 heads. So, the probability is: \[
P(X \geq 8) = P(X = 8) + P(X = 9) + P(X = 10)
